OL,3,GNEWSAThousands back call for hospital
OL,4,Aurgent care upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of residents have signed an
OL,7,FMP's open letter calling on NHS bosses
OL,8,Fto provide doctor-led urgent care at a
OL,9,Ftown's hospital.
OL,11,FThe letter, penned by Rugby MP John
OL,12,FSlinger, calls for the nurse-led Urgent
OL,13,FTreatment Centre (UTC) at Hospital of
OL,14,FSt Cross in Rugby to be upgraded so
OL,15,Fmore patients can be seen by doctors
OL,16,Fcloser to home.
OL,18,FResident Simon Burne signed it after
OL,19,Fhis wife suffered a small stroke and
OL,20,Fhad to go to University Hospital
OL,21,FCoventry (UHC) which he said was
OL,22,F"absolute chaos".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
