OL,3,GNEWSAThousands back call for hospital
OL,4,Aurgent care upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Coventry and Warwickshire
OL,7,FIntegrated Care Board (ICB) said it had
OL,8,Finvited people across the region to
OL,9,Fshare their views on local urgent care,
OL,10,Fand their feedback was being used to
OL,11,Fshape a new model.
